<title>USA: Nitinol Medical filter approved by FDA.</title>
<headline>Nitinol Medical filter approved by FDA.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nitinol Medical Technologies Inc said Wednesday it received Food and Drug Administration clearance to market its Simon Nitinol Filter for implantation through the subclavian vein in the shoulder.</p>
<p>The company said the approval increases opportunity for physicians to adapt their implantation techniques to individual patient conditions.</p>
</text>
